# 16. Content Distribution at Scale

The architecture changes as the number of accounts increases.

### Small workflow

```text id="g0k2wx"
1–5 Accounts
      ↓
Content
      ↓
Scheduler
      ↓
Publishing
```

### Medium workflow

```text id="j8p3df"
Multiple Accounts
      ↓
Content Library
      ↓
Campaigns
      ↓
Scheduler
      ↓
Task Queue
      ↓
Workers
```

### Larger workflow

```text id="v4x8qj"
Content Library
      ↓
Transformation Pipeline
      ↓
Campaign Manager
      ↓
Distribution Rules
      ↓
Task Queue
      ↓
Worker Pool
      ↓
Account Environments
      ↓
Platforms
      ↓
Monitoring
      ↓
Analytics
```

The important change is that scale introduces more coordination problems.

