# 20. AI Agents for Content Operations

A more advanced architecture can introduce an AI agent as an orchestration layer.

```text id="2c6x0v"
                  AI Agent
                     │
        ┌────────────┼────────────┐
        ▼            ▼            ▼
     Content      Campaign     Monitoring
     Analysis     Planning     Analysis
        │            │            │
        └────────────┼────────────┘
                     ▼
              Automation Layer
                     │
             ┌───────┼───────┐
             ▼       ▼       ▼
         Scheduler Workers Accounts
```

The AI agent can make recommendations or decisions while the underlying automation infrastructure performs the actual tasks.

This creates a distinction between:

**Decision-making**

and

**Execution.**

