# 28. Practical Implementation With Automation Platforms

Building a complete distribution system from scratch can require multiple components:

* content storage
* media processing
* scheduling
* account management
* browser or API integrations
* task queues
* monitoring
* analytics

For teams that do not want to develop and maintain every component themselves, social media automation platforms can provide a significant portion of the operational layer.

JarveePro is one example of a platform that can be used to manage social media automation workflows across supported platforms and accounts.

The architecture described in this document remains useful even when using an existing platform because it provides a way to think about **content, accounts, tasks, execution, and monitoring as separate system components**.

